  "$comment": [
    "The padel clubs Kicksmash knows about, so a player, a coach or a club can pick one by name",
    "instead of typing it and hoping. Read by scripts/import-clubs.mjs, which only ever touches rows",
    "nobody has claimed: once a club owner claims their page, this file stops being the truth about it.",
    "",
    "Every row came from a public source, listed in `sources`. A value nobody published is null, never",
    "a guess: a wrong court count on a real club is worse than no court count. Corrections are one line",
    "and a re-run.",
    "",
    "Where people have already played at a club, the slug here is the one their matches already",
    "carry (`warehaus`, `blue-tree`), never a tidier new one. A slug is the club's address: its venue",
    "page, its matches, the coaches who list it. A second slug for the same place would split the",
    "club's history in two, and only the first half would have anybody in it.",
    "",
    "`courts` is the total. `courtsIndoor` and `courtsOutdoor` split it where a source said; sheltered",
    "and covered count as indoor, because what a player wants to know is whether rain or midday sun",
    "stops the game. They do not have to add up to `courts` when a source only gave part of the picture.",
    "",
    "Compiled 15-16 September 2026. Not a census and not claimed as one: it is every club with a web",
    "presence that public sources named, and the open questions are in the research notes."
